             CPU/MEM/GPU and the dynamically-built Disk gauges, so it needs top
             clearance from the ring as well as the label below it - a few px
             on each side keeps it from looking glued to either neighbor. Only
             the static SYSTEM JUNK gauge still nests this inside its ring; the
             small top margin reads fine there too. -->
